## Constitutional Compliance

### SOLID Principles

- Single Responsibility: Each component has one clear purpose
- Open/Closed: Extensible through props and composition
- Liskov Substitution: Interchangeable component variants
- Interface Segregation: Focused component APIs
- Dependency Inversion: Abstract AI provider interfaces

### Performance First

- Next.js optimization features mandatory
- Hardware-accelerated animations only
- Image optimization for all generated content
- Lazy loading for non-critical components

### Component Guidelines

- Extend Shadcn/UI components, never modify directly
- Self-contained components with clear props interface
- Comprehensive error boundaries for AI operations
- Accessibility features built-in (WCAG 2.1 AA)

